  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Tanzania Country Programme 2025 &#x2013; 2026 Business Plan by TradeMark Africa aims to strengthen Tanzania&#x2019;s trade and export capability in order to contribute to sustainable and inclusive prosperity. It includes objectives on increased resilience and empowerment of women and youth through mentorship and training; an enhanced trade and Investment environment in Tanzania; and greening trade through the rollout of carbon certification and green trade systems.The programme is implemented in Tanzania mainland and Zanzibar contributing to two main outcomes: 1) Increase market access/ Reduce barriers to trade: and Outcome 2) Improve Business Competitiveness.</narrative>
  </description>
